      "text": "Every year, thousands of people travel to the coast for the Sunny Beats Music Festival. It is a fantastic event where you can listen to live bands and enjoy the beach. This year, the festival organizers have decided to (1) _____ the event to three days instead of two. Many people choose to (2) _____ in tents at the nearby campsite, which is a great way to meet new friends. If you prefer more comfort, there are also many hotels in the town. You should book your tickets early because they (3) _____ out very quickly. Don't forget to bring sunscreen, as it can get very hot during the day. It is also a good idea to (4) _____ a waterproof jacket, just in case it rains in the evening. The festival offers a wide (5) _____ of food from different countries, so you will definitely find something you like. It is an experience you will (6) _____ forget!",
